# Test and profiling binaries. `go test -c`, `go test -cover -o`, and anything
# built into the working tree.
*.test
*.exe
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Profiles from `go test -memprofile` and friends. These are written into the
# package directory by the benchmarks in AGENTS.md section 11.
*.prof
*.pprof
mem.out
cpu.out

# Go workspace files. A library should never check one in; it pins a developer's
# local checkout paths and breaks for everyone else.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Build output. `go build ./...` in this module writes nothing, so this only
# catches a stray `go build -o`.
/bin/
/dist/

# Editor and OS cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local scratch. AGENTS.md section 11 measures descriptor counts by writing
# throwaway modules under /tmp, and those must never be added here by accident.
*.tmp
